hful to his comic book counterpart  viewers get an expanded look at the  characters background before his face  was burnt on the show Dwight also share  some similarities to Daryl a character  who doesn't exist in the comics at all  Daryl was introduced about two years  before Dwight in the comics and many  were quick to notice that both carry a  crossbow Daryl quickly became a breakout  fan favorite on the series your worlds  about to get a whole lot bigger do you  want to see more character comparisons  let us know in the comments below and  subscribe for our latest videos
 

